Hi Team,

We are excited to announce that the Universal File Preview Engine v1.2 release preparation is completed.

Key Highlights:
- Over 50+ document, presentation, spreadsheet, and media formats supported client-side.
- Zero server-side rendering latency; 100% offline-ready in browser.
- Added native email preview support for .eml and .msg files.
- Default "fit to width" view across all visual previewers.

Timeline & Rollout:
- Phase 1 (Internal Staging): Sep 30, 2026
- Phase 2 (Global CDN Edge Mirrors): Oct 02, 2026

Please find the detailed release notes attached.

Best regards,
Elena Rostova
Lead Product Architect | Nexus Technologies

