=======================================================
UNIVERSAL FILE PREVIEW ENGINE v1.2 - RELEASE SPECIFICATION
=======================================================

1. Email Format Support:
   - Added RFC 822 / RFC 2822 (.eml) parsing and rendering.
   - Added Outlook MS-OXMSG (.msg) parsing and rendering.
   - Full support for multipart MIME, rich HTML, plain text, and attachment downloads.

2. Presentation Upgrades:
   - Modern PowerPoint (.pptx) and Legacy PowerPoint (.ppt) zero-overflow rendering.
   - Proportional aspect ratio containment and high-DPI canvas renderers.

3. Fit Strategy:
   - Standardized default fitMode to 'width' across all file types.

=======================================================
